# Sakoon AI — Project Core

## Layout
- `backend/` — FastAPI API (`/api/v1`), services, ML models in `backend/models/`
- `frontend/` — React + Vite; API client in `frontend/src/services/api.js`
- `database/init_sakoon.sql` — MySQL schema
- `docs/FRONTEND_BACKEND_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md` — frontend↔backend handbook

## Run (dev)
- Backend: `cd backend && python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000`
- Frontend: `cd frontend && npm run dev` → http://127.0.0.1:5173
- Health: http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

## Never commit
- `backend/.env`, `frontend/.env`, API keys, PATs, passwords

## Auth model (prototype)
- No JWT for users. Pass `userId` and `sessionId` in request bodies after register/login.
- Admin routes need header `X-Admin-Key` from `POST /admin/login`.

## Docs before guessing APIs
- `backend/API_COMPLETE_TEST_DOCUMENTATION.md`
- `backend/ROUTE_DOCUMENTATION.md`
